# Store and check out text as LF everywhere (rustfmt writes LF, and a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf would otherwise flip files to CRLF on every touch).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep TODOs readable in editors that display CR characters as ^M.
/TODOs.md text eol=lf

# Vendored third-party code and data: keep it out of GitHub's language stats and diffs.
crates/desktop/extensions/** linguist-vendored
crates/desktop/assets/** linguist-vendored
